ext0" x="308" y="488" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">1. Commit business state + notification event</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text1" x="820" y="680" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">2. Claim committed event</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text2" x="820" y="872" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">3. Order / shipment / refund event</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text3" x="1332" y="1064" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">4. Fan out to independent channels</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text4" x="1844" y="1256" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">5. Deliver at least once</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text5" x="820" y="1448" width="1496" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">6. Resolve consent/template; record unique send intent</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text6" x="2356" y="1640" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">7. Send email or registered SMS</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text7" x="2356" y="1832" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">8. Provider acceptance / message ID</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text8" x="820" y="2024" width="1496" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">9. Store sent / unknown / failed attempt</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text9" x="1844" y="2216" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">10. Delivery feedback through event adapter</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text10" x="1844" y="2408" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">11. Process receipt / retry / DLQ</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text11" x="820" y="2600" width="1496" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">12. Update delivery outcome; suppress invalid recipients</textArea><textArea id="06-notifications_text12" x="64" y="3520" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Send acceptance is not delivery. Persistent dedupe limits repeats; ambiguous sends need a defined retry policy. SES production access; India SMS entity/template registration; marketing consent is separate.</textArea></g></svg>